<![CDATA[<h1>07. 运算符</h1><p>Author: Chiyuki(l12345p9876x0@gmail.com)</p>
        
          <h2 id="算术运算符">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e7%ae%97%e6%9c%af%e8%bf%90%e7%ae%97%e7%ac%a6"></a>
算术运算符
</h2><p><img src="/python/attachments/Pasted%20image%2020250402195918.png" alt=""></p>
<table>
	<thead>
			<tr>
					<th>运算符</th>
					<th>说明</th>
					<th>实例</th>
			</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
			<tr>
					<td><code>+</code></td>
					<td>加，或取正（取正通常省略）,拼接</td>
					<td><code>a + b</code>、<code>+a</code></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>-</code></td>
					<td>减，或取负</td>
					<td><code>a - b</code>、<code>-a</code></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>*</code></td>
					<td>乘</td>
					<td><code>a * b</code></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>/</code></td>
					<td>除，结果总是 float</td>
					<td><code>a / b</code></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>//</code></td>
					<td>整除，除后向下取整</td>
					<td><code>a // b</code></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>%</code></td>
					<td>模，返回除法的余数</td>
					<td><code>a % b</code></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>**</code></td>
					<td>幂</td>
					<td><code>a ** b</code></td>
			</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">5</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">b</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">2</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;+&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;的结果为&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;-&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;的结果为&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;*&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;的结果为&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;-&#34;</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="mi">30</span><span class="p">)</span>   <span class="c1"># 输出 30 次 -</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;的&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;次方结果为&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">**</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;/&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;的结果为&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">/</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">)</span>    <span class="c1"># 注意：结果为浮点类型</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;//&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;的结果为&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">//</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;%&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;的结果为&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">%</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">5 + 2 的结果为 7
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">5 - 2 的结果为 3
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">5 * 2 的结果为 10
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">------------------------------
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">5 的 2 次方结果为 25
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">5 / 2 的结果为 2.5
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">5 // 2 的结果为 2
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">5 % 2 的结果为 1
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>+</code> 用于数字时表示加法，用于字符串时表示拼接；<code>*</code> 除了乘法，还可以重复字符串或序列，把 n 个同样的字符串连接起来：</p>
        
